cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the s2colour or arcgis_B weights, or the results, please cite this repository."
title: "Multi-date generative super-resolution of Sentinel-2 for India (VIYGAN-2, SIH26142)"
abstract: >-
  Multi-date ESRGAN super-resolution of Sentinel-2 L2A (8 dates, 10 m) to 2.39 m for India, with two models:
  arcgis_B (ArcGIS colours) and s2colour (Sentinel-2 band values locked per 10 m cell, trained with the lock inside
  the network).
